  "description": "Sometimes, we only discover our true gifts when we hit rock bottom. Take Da-Min Lee -- he’s a terrible soccer player, due to his almost supernatural talent at dodging any object thrown at him. But in another sport? It’s a whole other story. When Da-Min leaves the soccer team in disgrace after failing to save the game-deciding goal, he’s discovered by Tae-Gyun, captain of the épée team in the school fencing club. Impressed by Da-Min’s agility and evasiveness, Tae-Gyun offers Da-Min a chance at redemption in fencing. Will Da-Min find his true passion and make some friends along the way?\n\n(Source: WEBTOONS, edited)",
